sequenceDiagram
  participant U as 用户
  participant APIServer as Kubernetes API Server
  participant Webhook as vArmor Webhook
  participant PolicyCacher as Policy Cacher
  participant Controller as Policy Controller
  participant ArmorProfile as ArmorProfile
  participant ArmorProfileModel as ArmorProfileModel
  participant Agent as vArmor Agent
  participant Status as Status Manager
  participant Workload as Workload/Pod
  participant Node as 节点内核/运行时

  U->>APIServer: 创建或更新 VarmorPolicy / VarmorClusterPolicy
  APIServer->>Webhook: admission validate
  alt 校验失败
    Webhook-->>APIServer: reject request
    APIServer-->>U: 返回 Forbidden / Error
  else 校验通过
    Webhook-->>APIServer: allow request
    APIServer-->>PolicyCacher: informer 更新 target / enforcer / mode 缓存
    APIServer-->>Controller: informer 入队 reconcile

    alt 新建策略
      Controller->>Controller: ValidateAddPolicy + NewArmorProfile
      opt BehaviorModeling 模式
        Controller->>ArmorProfileModel: 重置已存在的建模状态
      end
      Controller->>ArmorProfile: 创建对象并绑定 ownerReference
    else 更新策略
      Controller->>Controller: ValidateUpdatePolicy + GenerateProfile
      opt BehaviorModeling 未完成
        Controller->>ArmorProfileModel: 重置建模状态与缓存
      end
      Controller->>ArmorProfile: 更新 spec / status
    end

    par 节点落地链路
      ArmorProfile-->>Agent: informer 分发 create / update 事件
      Agent->>Node: 保存或加载 AppArmor / BPF / Seccomp profile
      Agent->>Status: sendStatus(Succeeded / Failed)
      Status->>ArmorProfile: 汇总各节点加载状态
      Status->>APIServer: 更新 Policy / ClusterPolicy phase 与 ready
    and 准入注入链路
      Note over PolicyCacher,Workload: 后续目标 Workload 或 Pod 的 mutation 依赖缓存匹配
      Workload->>APIServer: 创建或更新命中 target 的 Workload / Pod
      APIServer->>Webhook: admission mutate
      Webhook->>PolicyCacher: ClusterPolicy 优先匹配 target
      Webhook-->>APIServer: 返回 JSON Patch
      APIServer-->>Workload: 写入 annotations / securityContext
    end

    opt updateExistingWorkloads=true
      Controller->>Workload: 更新模板注解并触发滚动重建
    end

    opt BehaviorModeling 模式
      Agent->>Status: 上报行为数据
      Status->>ArmorProfileModel: 持久化模型数据或落盘
      Status->>APIServer: 建模完成后推进 phase=Completed
    end
  end

  U->>APIServer: 删除 Policy CR
  APIServer-->>PolicyCacher: informer 删除缓存
  APIServer-->>Controller: informer 入队 delete 事件
  Controller->>ArmorProfile: 移除 finalizers 并触发删除
  opt updateExistingWorkloads=true
    Controller->>Workload: 删除注解并触发滚动重建
  end
  ArmorProfile-->>Agent: informer 分发 delete 事件
  Agent->>Node: 卸载并删除 AppArmor / BPF / Seccomp profile
  Status->>APIServer: 清理 PolicyStatus / ModelingStatus 缓存